* OrderFulfillmentWorkflowImpl
** Temporal boundary methods <<boundary>>
*** @WorkflowInit constructor(OrderFulfillmentWorkflowInput)
*** @WorkflowMethod execute(OrderFulfillmentWorkflowInput)
*** @SignalMethod allocationCommitted()
*** @SignalMethod shipmentHandedOverToCarrier()
*** @SignalMethod shipmentCancelled()
*** @UpdateValidatorMethod validateCancellationRequest()
*** @UpdateMethod requestCancellation()
*** @QueryMethod state()
** execute 主線 helpers
*** Typed Activity stubs
**** InventoryActivities / OrderingActivities / WmsActivities
**** 共用 retry policy；各 use case 自己保證業務冪等
*** Allocation checkpoint
**** AllocationCheckpoint.notRequested() / waiting()
**** isWaiting() / isCommitted()
**** committed() / requireCommittedSnapshot()
**** allocationId() / requireWaiting()
*** Shipment checkpoint
**** ShipmentCheckpoint.recordCreated()
**** recordHandover() / recordCancelled()
**** canAcceptTerminalFor() <<guard>>
**** hasTerminal() / hasHandover()
**** requireShipmentId() / requireTerminal() <<guard>>
**** shipmentIdOrNull() / terminalStatusOrNull() / terminalAtOrNull()
*** Cancellation checkpoint
**** CancellationCheckpoint.isRequested()
**** requireRequest() <<guard>>
**** requestIdOrNull() / requestedAtOrNull()
*** Mainline helpers
**** finish()
** 取消協調 helpers <<cancellation>>
*** requestShipmentCancellation()：command ACK，不代表 terminal
*** cancelOrderInOrdering(cancelledAt)
*** finishCancellation()
** Query／progress helpers <<projection>>
*** WorkflowProgress.enter() / update()
*** workflowNow()
*** activityOptions()

legend bottom
  |<#E8F1FF>| Temporal boundary |
